     1	"""jcp-combined 2D error-budget job `c2bud` (DESIGN 5 as amended by A1.4, A1.5, A2.3, A2.4, A3.6; runs after the frozen
     2	selection). One GPU, all dev6 + val32 cases. Every run is an end-to-end query of t2core (C2) on one setting; only the
     3	ingredient named changes; the initial coefficients are identical across every run of a setting and case (asserted).
     4	
     5	Per setting (name, R', main rule r) and budget arm a = (form f, scheme s, step factor h, production tolerance) from
     6	checks/FROZEN-SELECTION.json (selected arms, flagged) plus the pre-specified diagnostic arms (A1.5):
     7	  a                               the arm
     8	  a[r -> r_inf]                   quadrature ablation (r_inf = converged rule, Gauss 320^2)
     9	  a[sigma -> tight]               solver ablation
    10	  a[sigma -> tight, f -> GAL]     form sensitivity at tight tolerance (LSPG arms only)
    11	  a[(s, h) -> (BDF2, h0/8)]       temporal-discretisation package (same form, rule, tolerance)
    12	  a[sigma -> tight, h -> h/2]     within-scheme refinement (with a[tight])
    13	  mixed-difference corners        (r_inf, f, BDF2, h0/8, prod) and (r, f, BDF2, h0/8, tight)
    14	Per setting: the ideal star = (r_inf, GAL, BDF2, h0/8, tight) with its qualification (h0/16 tight; tighter replays of
    15	both), the ideal-end changes star[r_inf -> r] (= the deployed-rule anchor) and star[GAL -> LSPG].
    16	Converged-rule check (A2.4): on dev6 + the first 10 val32 cases, every run using r_inf is repeated with the check rule
    17	(Gauss 640^2); bar 2.5e-5 (worst field distance on the 257^2 nodes / ||u0||). If it fails, the successor (r_inf = 640^2,
    18	check 768^2) is run instead, decided in-job before the remaining cases; failing again -> 'converged rule unverified'.
    19	Finalists (A3.6): every SELECTED arm also runs with the check rule on every case.
    20	Outputs: result.json (rows: errors vs ST / S / TX per time, verification, statistics), WB_<setting>.npz (coefficients of
    21	every run), COMPLETE. All distances and the budget are computed offline (budget2d.py) from the saved coefficients.
    22	
    23	    python c2bud.py --config configs/c2bud.json --out <dir> [--dry-run]
    24	"""
    25	from __future__ import annotations
    26	
